OL,3,GNEWSAHackers publish 320,000 school
OL,4,Afiles on dark web
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 320,000 files stolen in a
OL,7,Fcyber attack on a council's schools
OL,8,Fserver have been found on the dark web.
OL,10,FBristol City Council said the personal
OL,11,Fdata was stolen from 39 of the schools
OL,12,Fthat use its Trading with Schools
OL,13,Fplatform, which was hacked in
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FHead teachers have been informed about
OL,17,Fthe development and are issuing
OL,18,Fguidance to families at the affected
OL,19,Fschools. The council said it was unable
OL,20,Fto confirm the details of the data at
OL,21,Fthis time.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
